 "description": "Property Reference: 2617704.\n\nSuperbly located and well appointed flat right in Zone 1. Connected to a large number of main tube, bus and train and airports, within walking distance. (Hammersmith & City, Circle, Central, District, Elizabeth and Bakerloo line. Heathrow Express. Bus 7,23, 27, 36, 94 all within minutes).Wonderfully quiet, but right in the middle of all major conveniences, which include a large Waitrose across the road, and many nice shops such as coffee shops and convenience stores, butting onto the newly refurbished Six Senses @Whiteleys and regenerated Queensway area. Lots of fantastic restaurants and on Westbourne Grove and close to Notting Hill and Portobello road. \n\n10 min walk to Hyde Park, and a local small park, fenced in, right across the road.\nLibrary, gym, swimming pool and spa right next door. \n\n1 bed set up suitable for a professional single or professional couple, with large living room, and well sized bathroom. Very large bedroom and living dining, with excellent storage capacity.\n\nClean, tidy, well looked after, very comfortable.\nAll bills included.\n\nThe flat is basically yours. There is a locked second bedroom, where we will stay from time to time.\n\nSummary & Exclusions:\n- Rent Amount: £2,200.00 per month (£507.69 per week)\n- Deposit / Bond: £2,200.00\n- 1 Bedroom Property (1 room currently available for rent)\n- 1 Bathrooms\n- Property comes furnished\n- Available to move in from 29 August 2026\n- Maximum number of tenants is 2\n- No Students\n- No Smokers\n- Bills Included\n- No Parking Available\n- No Garden Access\n- EPC Rating: EPC Not Required (Shared Accommodation)\n\n  If calling, please quote reference: 2617704  \n\nFees:\nYou will not be charged any admin fees.\n\n ** Contact today to book a viewing and have the landlord show you round! ** \nRequest Details form responded to 24/7, with phone bookings available 9am-9pm, 7 days a week.",
